      "text": "My absolute favorite place in the world 🌎!!!   🏖☀ I have enjoyed the blessings of going there almost every year for 20 years…and no other island comes close! When I go…in my heart…I am “home!” It’s spectacular to me, I love the people, the peace, the elegance…the gorgeous ocean and turquoise sea…dotted with pink sand beaches…and a snorkeling delight!  Please, don’t pass it up.if given an opportunity, take it! I go by cruise…3 days there. NCL  has the newest ship, the Acqua…and it’s lovely! Thanks to The Lord for the glorious island that stole my heart! ♥ And a big thank you to all you in Bermuda for making every trip, a dream come true…I love you all!   👩🏻‍🦳✝🙏🏻👑🛟⚓🐏🤲🐑🙌🇺🇸❤🐚🩴🐬🌊🤿🏊‍♀🌊🏝🩳🩱⛱🐠🐟🎏🎣🇧🇲🇺🇸🩷💙💛",
